    "name": "Smithsonian Open Access Content API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Smithsonian Open Access API provides programmatic access to the Smithsonian Institution's publicly available collection data. Search and retrieve objects, artworks, natural history specimens, and related media from 19 museums, 21 libraries, and 9 research centers. Requires an API key from api.data.gov.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Smithsonian Open Access\n Email: openaccess@si.edu",
